$fieldc2 = stripslashes('<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">VATSIM Vs IVAO<br />
WHICH NETWORK TO CHOOSE</span></strong></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>

<p data-end=\"328\" data-start=\"197\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Want to fly online but not sure which network to choose or where to start?<br data-end=\"124\" data-start=\"121\" />
Here are some answers to your questions.<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p data-end=\"328\" data-start=\"197\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p>

<p data-end=\"597\" data-start=\"330\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Flying on an online network allows you to fly as a group and see each aircraft in flight or on the ground. But most importantly — and this is the key point — you can receive <strong>air traffic control services</strong> provided by volunteer virtual controllers, just like in real life.<br data-end=\"329\" data-start=\"326\" />
Virtual pilots and controllers number <strong>in the thousands around the world</strong>. On networks such as VATSIM and IVAO, you can meet enthusiasts from all backgrounds: aviation students, real-world pilots, professional controllers, as well as aviation fans who simply want to experience flight with maximum realism. Thanks to their presence, airports can benefit from full ATC coverage, sometimes for an entire day during major events.<br data-end=\"756\" data-start=\"753\" />
You might take off from Paris under French control, then cross airspaces managed by other countries, all the way to your destination where another controller will guide you for approach and landing. This international and collaborative dimension makes every flight unique and remarkably close to real-world operations.<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p data-end=\"597\" data-start=\"330\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p>

<p data-end=\"849\" data-start=\"599\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Flying online offers <strong>an unmatched level of immersion</strong>: real radio communications, professional procedures, adherence to air traffic rules, careful flight planning… In short, a true step into serious and realistic virtual aviation!<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p data-end=\"849\" data-start=\"599\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#333399;\"></span></p>

<h2 data-end=\"885\" data-start=\"856\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong>Why fly online?</strong></span></h2>

<p data-end=\"919\" data-start=\"887\">Here are the main advantages:</p>

<ul data-end=\"1287\" data-start=\"921\">
	<li data-end=\"1005\" data-start=\"921\">
	<p data-end=\"1005\" data-start=\"923\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong data-end=\"945\" data-start=\"923\">Realistic immersion</strong> : human ATC, sound environment, real traffic around you</span></p>
	</li>
	<li data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"1006\">
	<p data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"1008\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1008\">Learning</strong> :&nbsp;</span>improve your phraseology and navigation skills</p>
	</li>
	<li data-end=\"1150\" data-start=\"1079\">
	<p data-end=\"1150\" data-start=\"1081\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong data-end=\"1095\" data-start=\"1081\">Community</strong> :&nbsp;</span>you no longer fly alone, you share a passion with others</p>
	</li>
	<li data-end=\"1221\" data-start=\"1151\">
	<p data-end=\"1221\" data-start=\"1153\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong data-end=\"1167\" data-start=\"1153\">Events</strong> :&nbsp;</span>full ATC evenings, group flights, and challenges</p>
	</li>
	<li data-end=\"1287\" data-start=\"1222\">
	<p data-end=\"1287\" data-start=\"1224\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong data-end=\"1238\" data-start=\"1224\">Motivation</strong> :&nbsp;</span>following procedures gives purpose and meaning to your flights</p>
	</li>
</ul>

<p data-end=\"1341\" data-start=\"1289\"><span style=\"color:#333399;\">🛠 </span><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Or course you\'ll need a little time to adjust :</span></p>

<ul data-end=\"1484\" data-start=\"1342\">
	<li data-end=\"1382\" data-start=\"1342\">
	<p data-end=\"1382\" data-start=\"1344\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Learning the basics of radio communication</span></p>
	</li>
	<li data-end=\"1442\" data-start=\"1383\">
	<p data-end=\"1442\" data-start=\"1385\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Following rules (frequencies, flight plan, clearances)</span></p>
	</li>
	<li data-end=\"1484\" data-start=\"1443\">
	<p data-end=\"1484\" data-start=\"1445\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Install a connection client</span></p>
	</li>
</ul>

<p data-end=\"1555\" data-start=\"1486\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">But don’t worry: everything can be learned, and everyone was a beginner at some point!<br data-end=\"293\" data-start=\"290\" />
These networks are built on mutual help and tolerance, every newcomer has their place!<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p data-end=\"1555\" data-start=\"1486\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#333399;\"></span></p>

<p data-end=\"1555\" data-start=\"1486\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Although several networks exist, both paid and free, we will focus only on the two main free networks, known for being the most complete and active.<span style=\"color:#000000;\">.</span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p data-end=\"1555\" data-start=\"1486\"></p>

<h2 data-end=\"1592\" data-start=\"1562\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong>The two main networks</strong></span><br />
&nbsp;</h2>

<p><span style=\"color:#333399;\"></span></p>

<h3 data-end=\"1607\" data-start=\"1594\"><span style=\"color:#333399;\">✈️ </span><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong>VATSIM</strong></span></h3>

<ul data-end=\"1827\" data-start=\"1608\">
	<li data-end=\"1643\" data-start=\"1608\">
	<p data-end=\"1643\" data-start=\"1610\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Very extensive worlwide coverage.</span></p>
	</li>
	<li data-end=\"1680\" data-start=\"1644\">
	<p data-end=\"1680\" data-start=\"1646\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">A lot of international traffic.</span></p>
	</li>
	<li data-end=\"1729\" data-start=\"1681\">
	<p data-end=\"1729\" data-start=\"1683\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">ATC is generally a bit stricter and more demanding, but much more realistic.</span></p>
	</li>
	<li data-end=\"1779\" data-start=\"1730\">
	<p data-end=\"1779\" data-start=\"1732\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">Very active in North America and the United Kingdom, and increasingly in Europe.</span></p>
	</li>
	<li data-end=\"1827\" data-start=\"1780\">
	<p data-end=\"1827\" data-start=\"1782\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">On average, there are more than three times as many users connected simultaneously compared to IVAO.</span></p>
	</li>
</ul>

<p data-end=\"1904\" data-start=\"1829\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong data-end=\"1843\" data-start=\"1829\">For whom ?</strong></span><span style=\"color:#333399;\"><br data-end=\"1846\" data-start=\"1843\" />
👉 </span><span style=\"color:#000000;\">For those who want a realistic and highly structured environment.</span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p data-end=\"1904\" data-start=\"1829\"><span style=\"color:#333399;\"></span></p>

